{
  "name": "veriflow-agency",
  "displayName": "Agency",
  "description": "Specialisté, které si najmeš do repozitáře. Recenze pull requestů s doloženými nálezy, triage přímo u kódu a měřitelná precision.",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "publisher": "veriflow",
  "license": "UNLICENSED",
  "private": true,
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.85.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Other",
    "Linters"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "code review",
    "pull request",
    "triage"
  ],
  "main": "./src/extension.js",
  "activationEvents": [
    "onStartupFinished"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "package": "node -e \"require('fs').mkdirSync('../../dist',{recursive:true})\" && npx --yes @vscode/vsce package --no-dependencies --allow-missing-repository --out ../../dist/",
    "test": "node test/harness.js"
  },
  "contributes": {
    "viewsContainers": {
      "activitybar": [
        {
          "id": "agency",
          "title": "Agency",
          "icon": "resources/agency.svg"
        }
      ]
    },
    "views": {
      "agency": [
        {
          "id": "agency.overview",
          "name": "Přehled",
          "icon": "$(dashboard)"
        },
        {
          "id": "agency.findings",
          "name": "Nálezy",
          "icon": "$(inbox)"
        },
        {
          "id": "agency.runs",
          "name": "Běhy",
          "icon": "$(history)",
          "visibility": "collapsed"
        },
        {
          "id": "agency.tools",
          "name": "Specialisté",
          "icon": "$(person)",
          "visibility": "collapsed"
        }
      ]
    },
    "viewsWelcome": [
      {
        "view": "agency.overview",
        "when": "!agency.ready && agency.reason == no-folder",
        "contents": "Agency pracuje uvnitř projektu.\n\nOtevři složku s git repozitářem a panel se naplní sám.\n\n[Otevřít složku](command:vscode.openFolder)"
      },
      {
        "view": "agency.overview",
        "when": "!agency.ready && agency.reason == no-cli",
        "contents": "Chybí jádro.\n\nExtension je jen klient — všechnu práci dělá příkaz `agency`, ten samý, který volá agent z terminálu.\n\nNainstaluj ho:\n\n```\nuv tool install --editable <veriflow-agency>/packages/core\n```\n\n[Nastavit cestu k agency](command:agency.openSettings)\n[Zkusit znovu](command:agency.refresh)"
      },
      {
        "view": "agency.overview",
        "when": "!agency.ready && agency.reason == no-repo",
        "contents": "Tady není git repozitář.\n\nNálezy se ukládají do `.agency/` uvnitř projektu, aby přežily přeinstalaci i nové naklonování — bez repozitáře nemá kam.\n\n[Zkusit znovu](command:agency.refresh)"
      },
      {
        "view": "agency.overview",
        "when": "!agency.ready && agency.reason == error",
        "contents": "Agency se nepodařilo spustit. Detail je v Output → Agency.\n\n[Ověřit předpoklady](command:agency.doctor)\n[Zkusit znovu](command:agency.refresh)"
      },
      {
        "view": "agency.findings",
        "when": "agency.ready && !agency.hasRuns",
        "contents": "Zatím žádný běh.\n\nRecenzent projde pull request, zkříží změny se skutečnou strukturou kódu a napíše nálezy — každý s evidencí a s odkazem na řádek, který přežije i pozdější změny.\n\n[Zrecenzovat pull request](command:agency.review.pick)\n\nBěh se pouští ve viditelném terminálu, ne na pozadí: attended je vlastnost systému, ne úmysl."
      },
      {
        "view": "agency.findings",
        "when": "agency.ready && agency.hasRuns && !agency.hasFindings",
        "contents": "Běh proběhl, ale nálezy tu ještě nejsou.\n\nAgent zapisuje `findings.json` na konci práce. Pak je potřeba je protáhnout bránou — ta ověří kontrakt, existenci souborů a duplicitu.\n\n[Zpracovat výsledek běhu](command:agency.ingest)\n[Zrecenzovat další PR](command:agency.review.pick)"
      },
      {
        "view": "agency.tools",
        "when": "agency.ready",
        "contents": "Specialista (pack) je metoda práce, ne obsah. Instalací dostane projekt jeho postup a konfiguraci; pravidla a dokumentace zůstávají projektu.\n\n[Najmout specialistu](command:agency.pack.add)"
      }
    ],
    "configuration": {
      "title": "Agency",
      "properties": {
        "agency.cliPath": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "agency",
          "markdownDescription": "Cesta k příkazu `agency`. Nech `agency`, když je v PATH; `uv tool install` ho umí položit i mimo něj.",
          "order": 1
        },
        "agency.pack": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "review-graph",
          "description": "Kterého specialistu spouští „Zrecenzovat pull request“.",
          "order": 2
        },
        "agency.model": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "default": null,
          "markdownDescription": "Model pro tenhle projekt. Prázdné = použije se `agent.model` z konfigurace packu.\n\nModel je vlastnost úkolu, ne uživatele: recenze je čtení a klasifikace, ne psaní, takže se dá pustit levněji než kódování. Volba se zapisuje do run recordu, aby šlo změřit, který model dává lepší nálezy.",
          "order": 3
        },
        "agency.provider": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "enum": [
            null,
            "claude",
            "codex"
          ],
          "default": null,
          "markdownDescription": "Čím běh spustit. Prázdné = `agent.provider` z konfigurace packu.",
          "order": 4
        },
        "agency.commentThreads": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "markdownDescription": "Ukazovat nálezy jako komentáře přímo u řádku kódu. Vypnutím zůstane jen panel Agency.",
          "order": 5
        },
        "agency.autoRefresh": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "markdownDescription": "Přenačíst, když se `.agency/runs/` změní zvenčí — tedy když rozhodne agent nebo terminál. Vypnutím se změny projeví až po ručním obnovení.",
          "order": 6
        }
      }
    },
    "submenus": [
      {
        "id": "agency.rejectMenu",
        "label": "Zamítnout",
        "icon": "$(circle-slash)"
      }
    ],
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "agency.review.pick",
        "title": "Zrecenzovat pull request…",
        "category": "Agency",
        "icon": "$(play)"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.ingest",
        "title": "Zpracovat výsledek běhu",
        "category": "Agency",
        "icon": "$(filter)"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.refresh",
        "title": "Přenačíst",
        "category": "Agency",
        "icon": "$(refresh)"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.doctor",
        "title": "Ověřit předpoklady",
        "category": "Agency",
        "icon": "$(pulse)"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.metrics",
        "title": "Metriky — precision, dedup, fronta",
        "category": "Agency",
        "icon": "$(graph)"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.openSettings",
        "title": "Nastavení",
        "category": "Agency",
        "icon": "$(settings-gear)"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.pack.add",
        "title": "Najmout specialistu…",
        "category": "Agency",
        "icon": "$(person-add)"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.pack.openConfig",
        "title": "Otevřít konfiguraci packu",
        "category": "Agency"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.finding.open",
        "title": "Otevřít detail nálezu",
        "category": "Agency",
        "icon": "$(book)"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.finding.reveal",
        "title": "Ukázat v kódu",
        "category": "Agency",
        "icon": "$(go-to-file)"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.finding.accept",
        "title": "Přijmout",
        "icon": "$(check)"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.finding.defer",
        "title": "Odložit na později",
        "icon": "$(bookmark)"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.finding.reject.not-reproducible",
        "title": "Nešlo zopakovat"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.finding.reject.by-design",
        "title": "Chová se tak záměrně"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.finding.reject.wrong-diagnosis",
        "title": "Špatná diagnóza — problém je jinde"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.finding.reject.duplicate-missed",
        "title": "Duplicita, kterou dedup nechytil"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.finding.reject.out-of-scope",
        "title": "Mimo rozsah projektu"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.finding.rejectPick",
        "title": "Zamítnout…",
        "icon": "$(circle-slash)"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.finding.addNote",
        "title": "Uložit poznámku"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.finding.openAtCommit",
        "title": "Ukázat kód v den analýzy",
        "icon": "$(history)"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.finding.diffAgainstHead",
        "title": "Porovnat s pracovní kopií",
        "icon": "$(git-compare)"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.decision.apply",
        "title": "Zapsat rozhodnutí (programaticky)",
        "category": "Agency"
      },
      {
        "command": "agency.view.findings.focus",
        "title": "Přejít na frontu nálezů",
        "category": "Agency"
      }
    ],
    "menus": {
      "commandPalette": [
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.accept",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.defer",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.rejectPick",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.addNote",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.reject.not-reproducible",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.reject.by-design",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.reject.wrong-diagnosis",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.reject.duplicate-missed",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.reject.out-of-scope",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.openAtCommit",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.diffAgainstHead",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.open",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.reveal",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.pack.openConfig",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.decision.apply",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.view.findings.focus",
          "when": "false"
        }
      ],
      "view/title": [
        {
          "command": "agency.review.pick",
          "group": "navigation@1",
          "when": "view == agency.overview || view == agency.runs"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.ingest",
          "group": "navigation@2",
          "when": "view == agency.runs"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.metrics",
          "group": "navigation@1",
          "when": "view == agency.findings"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.refresh",
          "group": "navigation@8",
          "when": "view == agency.overview || view == agency.findings"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.pack.add",
          "group": "navigation@1",
          "when": "view == agency.tools"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.doctor",
          "group": "1_check@1",
          "when": "view == agency.overview"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.openSettings",
          "group": "9_config@1",
          "when": "view == agency.overview || view == agency.tools"
        }
      ],
      "view/item/context": [
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.accept",
          "group": "inline@1",
          "when": "viewItem == agencyFinding.open"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.rejectPick",
          "group": "inline@2",
          "when": "viewItem == agencyFinding.open"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.reveal",
          "group": "inline@3",
          "when": "viewItem =~ /^agencyFinding/"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.defer",
          "group": "1_decide@1",
          "when": "viewItem == agencyFinding.open"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.openAtCommit",
          "group": "2_look@1",
          "when": "viewItem =~ /^agencyFinding/"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.diffAgainstHead",
          "group": "2_look@2",
          "when": "viewItem =~ /^agencyFinding/"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.pack.add",
          "group": "inline@1",
          "when": "viewItem == agencyPack.available"
        }
      ],
      "comments/commentThread/title": [
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.accept",
          "group": "inline@1",
          "when": "commentController == agency.findings"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.defer",
          "group": "inline@2",
          "when": "commentController == agency.findings"
        },
        {
          "submenu": "agency.rejectMenu",
          "group": "inline@3",
          "when": "commentController == agency.findings"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.open",
          "group": "inline@4",
          "when": "commentController == agency.findings"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.openAtCommit",
          "group": "inline@5",
          "when": "commentController == agency.findings"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.diffAgainstHead",
          "group": "inline@6",
          "when": "commentController == agency.findings && commentThread == agencyFinding.drifted"
        }
      ],
      "agency.rejectMenu": [
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.reject.not-reproducible",
          "group": "1_reasons@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.reject.by-design",
          "group": "1_reasons@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.reject.wrong-diagnosis",
          "group": "1_reasons@3"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.reject.duplicate-missed",
          "group": "1_reasons@4"
        },
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.reject.out-of-scope",
          "group": "1_reasons@5"
        }
      ],
      "comments/commentThread/context": [
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.addNote",
          "group": "inline@1",
          "when": "commentController == agency.findings"
        }
      ],
      "comments/comment/context": [
        {
          "command": "agency.finding.rejectPick",
          "group": "inline@1",
          "when": "commentController == agency.findings"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
